=== 4. DESIGN TOKENS ===
Light mode: background #FFFFFF; surface-1 #F6F7F9 (cards on tinted areas, inputs); surface-2 #ECEEF2; border #E4E6EB; text-primary #12141A; text-secondary #5B6270; text-tertiary #8A91A0; accent (per university, default indigo) #4F46E5; accent-tint #EEF0FF; accent-hover #4338CA; verified-blue #2F6FED; amber #F5A524 (live/event only); success #16A34A; danger #DC2626; danger-tint #FDECEC.
Dark mode (designed with equal care, never a colour inversion): background #0E1013; surface-1 #171A1F; surface-2 #1E2228; border #2A2F37; text-primary #F2F3F5; text-secondary #A3A9B6; text-tertiary #7C8392; accent on dark is lifted so it stays readable (indigo #8B93FF for text/icons, #6366F1 for filled buttons with white text); accent-tint on dark = accent at 16% over surface; danger #F87171. No green or tinted card backgrounds unless the university's accent says so, and even then only as a 10 to 16% tint on the accent-tint surface.
University theming: only accent, accent-tint and logo change per university; everything else is fixed. Compute accent-tint and dark-mode accent variants automatically from the accent colour (and enforce AA contrast).
Typography: screen title 22/28 Plus Jakarta Sans 700; section title 18/24 600; card name 16/22 600; body 16/24 Inter 400; secondary 14/20; caption 12/16; buttons 15/20 600; tab labels 11/14 500. Tight tracking on headings (-0.01em). Max two sizes plus one caption size inside any single card.
Spacing: 4px grid (4, 8, 12, 16, 20, 24, 32, 40). Screen side padding 16. Vertical gap between feed cards 12. Card inner padding 16.
Radius: cards 16, buttons 12, inputs 12, chips 999, bottom sheets 24 (top corners), dialogs 20, images 12, avatars 999.
Elevation: flat. 1px border tokens on cards. Shadows only on floating elements: Create button (0 6px 16px accent at 35%), toasts, menus, the New posts pill (0 4px 12px black at 14%).
Icons: Lucide, 24px default, 20px inside action rows, stroke 2 (1.75 in dark mode), colour text-secondary, active states accent.
Motion: 150 to 250 ms, ease-out. Sheets rise with a light spring, likes pop (scale 1 -> 1.2 -> 1), pill fades and slides 8px. Respect prefers-reduced-motion. No looping animations except skeleton shimmer (1.4s, subtle).
Glass (floating layers only): top bar, bottom tab bar, bottom sheets. Background white 70% (dark: #0E1013 70%), backdrop-filter blur(10px) saturate(1.4), 1px border white 60% (dark: white 8%). Automatic SOLID fallback when prefers-reduced-transparency, Data saver is on, low-end device (deviceMemory <= 2 or hardwareConcurrency <= 4), or backdrop-filter is unsupported. Never more than 3 glass surfaces visible, never animate blur.
Touch targets: minimum 44x44.

